// AWS Console Password Recovery Requested  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1078.004, T1098
// Detects a request to recover/reset an AWS console password (PasswordRecoveryRequested). Attackers may trigger password recovery as part of…
// False positives: Legitimate users who forgot their password.
// Source: rules/initial-access/password-recovery-requested.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where eventName=="PasswordRecoveryRequested" and eventSource=="signin.amazonaws.com"
